<title>CHINA: TABLE - Lianhua reverses loss in H1 '97.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Lianhua reverses loss in H1 '97.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated, against 1996 figures)</p>
<p> Turnover		  115.956	  vs    85.204</p>
<p> Net profit		  5.401	  vs   - 6.404</p>
<p> Net asset per share     1.70 yuan    vs     1.62 yuan</p>
<p> Earnings per share	0.032 yuan   vs   - 0.038 yuan</p>
<p>Company name: Shanghai Lianhua Fibre Co Ltd, a textile maker.</p>
<p>Note: The results were contained in a company statement published in the Shanghai Securities News on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The figures are unaudited as Chinese securities rules do not require listed firms to have their interim results audited.</p>
</text>
